            "heading": "Blended, not reduced",
            "text": "<p>A whole avocado blended into Greek yogurt with cucumber, dill, parsley, mint, garlic and lemon. The avocado is what gives it the colour and the body &mdash; no thickener, no long reduction.</p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
