    "shrimp_note": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "t:sections.custom-liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "section_id": "steelhead-doneness",
        "liquid": "<style>\n  .sea-pepper {\n    --ink: #171717;\n    --muted: #5c5c5c;\n    --line: #e5e2dc;\n    --wash: #faf8f4;\n    --gold: #bb8f50;\n    color: var(--ink);\n    background: var(--wash);\n    border: 1px solid var(--line);\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    padding: 30px;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 300px);\n    gap: 34px;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__eyebrow {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    letter-spacing: .14em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--gold);\n    font-weight: 600;\n    margin: 0 0 8px;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__heading {\n    font-size: clamp(23px, 2.8vw, 30px);\n    line-height: 1.15;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    margin: 0 0 10px;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__lede {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    color: var(--muted);\n    margin: 0 0 22px;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__rows {\n    display: grid;\n    gap: 14px;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__row {\n    background: #fff;\n    border: 1px solid var(--line);\n    border-radius: 14px;\n    padding: 15px 17px;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;\n    gap: 10px 16px;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__row--pick {\n    border-color: var(--gold);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--gold);\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__name {\n    grid-column: 1;\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__tag {\n    font-size: 10px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: .08em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: #fff;\n    background: var(--gold);\n    padding: 3px 8px;\n    border-radius: 999px;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__meter {\n    grid-column: 2;\n    grid-row: 1;\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 4px;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__pip {\n    width: 9px;\n    height: 9px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #fff;\n    border: 1.5px solid #d8cfc0;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__pip.is-on {\n    background: #b8462f;\n    border-color: #b8462f;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__note {\n    grid-column: 1 / -1;\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    color: var(--muted);\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__legend {\n    margin: 16px 0 0;\n    padding-top: 14px;\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    color: var(--muted);\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__figure {\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__figure img {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: auto;\n    display: block;\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    box-shadow: 0 14px 34px -22px rgba(0,0,0,.5);\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__cap {\n    margin: 10px 0 0;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    color: var(--muted);\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 989px) {\n    .sea-pepper {\n      padding: 22px;\n    }\n    .sea-pepper__grid {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n      gap: 24px;\n    }\n    .sea-pepper__figure {\n      order: -1;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"sea-pepper\">\n  <div class=\"sea-pepper__grid\">\n\n    <div class=\"sea-pepper__body\">\n      <p class=\"sea-pepper__eyebrow\">Watch the edges, not the clock</p>\n      <h2 class=\"sea-pepper__heading\">Six to eight minutes at 400&deg;F, but the colour is what tells you.</h2>\n      <p class=\"sea-pepper__lede\">\n        Cubes this size go from just-done to dry in about ninety seconds, and every air fryer runs\n        hotter or cooler than its dial claims. The signal is the corners: they colour before the\n        flat faces do, and once they are properly golden the middle is there. Flip once at the\n        halfway mark so both cut faces get the same air.\n      </p>\n\n      <div class=\"sea-pepper__rows\">\n      <div class=\"sea-pepper__row\">\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__name\">\n          <span>Pale, firming at the corners</span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__tag\">Not yet</span>\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"sea-pepper__meter\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Doneness: 2 out of 5\">\n        <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n        <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n        <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n        <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n        <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__note\">About three or four minutes in. The surface has set and gone opaque but there is no colour on it yet. Leave it &mdash; pulling here gives you steamed fish with a seasoned outside.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"sea-pepper__row sea-pepper__row--pick\">\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__name\">\n          <span>Golden corners, centre just opaque</span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__tag\">Pull it here</span>\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"sea-pepper__meter\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Doneness: 3 out of 5\">\n        <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n        <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n        <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n        <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n        <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__note\">Six to eight minutes, after the flip. The corners and edges have taken real colour, the flat faces are turning, and a fork slid into the thickest cube separates the flakes without resistance. This is the whole point of the recipe.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"sea-pepper__row\">\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__name\">\n          <span>Deep gold, edges going crisp-hard</span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__tag\">Last chance</span>\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"sea-pepper__meter\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Doneness: 4 out of 5\">\n        <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n        <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n        <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n        <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n        <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__note\">Still good if it goes straight into the bowl. The outside is past crisp and starting to harden, and the centre has lost some of its moisture. No margin left, and these keep cooking on a hot plate.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"sea-pepper__row\">\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__name\">\n          <span>Uniformly dark, flakes falling apart dry</span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__tag\">Overcooked</span>\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"sea-pepper__meter\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Doneness: 5 out of 5\">\n        <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n        <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n        <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n        <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n        <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__note\">The cubes have shrunk noticeably and the flesh crumbles rather than flakes. The tzatziki will mask it, which is the only thing to be said for it.</p>\n      </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <p class=\"sea-pepper__legend\">\n        Ratings are how far along the fish is, not how good. Two smaller batches beat one crowded\n        basket &mdash; cubes that touch trap steam between them, and steam is the one thing that\n        stops a crust forming.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <figure class=\"sea-pepper__figure\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0222/9882/0682/files/4_8b7337bf-094b-449c-a5cd-667a262f1128.png?width=700\" alt=\"Seasoned steelhead cubes spaced out in a single layer in the air fryer basket\" width=\"940\" height=\"1672\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n      <figcaption class=\"sea-pepper__cap\">\n        A single layer with air between every cube. From here you are watching the corners.\n      </figcaption>\n    </figure>\n\n  </div>\n</div>",
        "padding_top": 40,
        "padding_bottom": 16,
