        "m_text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The tzatziki keeps. Blend it a day ahead and refrigerate it with a film pressed to the surface &mdash; the lemon holds the avocado's colour overnight. Cook the rice ahead too. The fish is the only part that wants to be made to order, because the crust is the point and it softens as it sits.</p>",
